    "Add one extra direct set for shoulders and one for biceps within your existing Upper sessions to address the volume imbalance without overhauling your program.",
    "If scheduling four sessions in a week feels difficult, plan out your training days at the start of the week and treat them like fixed appointments to prevent the missed sessions from repeating."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "Routine adherence dropped to 50% this period with Upper B and Lower B missed, causing all strength indices to stall or slightly decline; the priority next period is full four-session attendance and restarting progressive overload."
}
